{"id":"deployment","title":"11. Deployment Modes","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"deployment","language":"markdown","description":"Step-by-step deployment guide for local development, hybrid mode with SAP HANA Cloud, and production Cloud Foundry.","sections":[],"content":"<h2>Deployment Modes</h2><h3>1. Production Mode (SAP BTP Cloud Foundry Multi-Buildpack)</h3><p>#### Prerequisites<br><ul><li>SAP BTP subaccount with Cloud Foundry runtime</li><br><li>Services provisioned: <code>xsuaa</code>, <code>destination</code>, <code>hana</code> (HDI-shared), <code>redis-instance</code></li><br><li>Cloud Foundry CLI (<code>cf</code>) installed and logged in</li><br><li>Multi-buildpack enabled space</li><br></ul><br>#### Deployment Steps</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 1. Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/yourusername/bookshop-multi-buildpack.git\ncd bookshop-multi-buildpack\n\n# 2. Install dependencies &amp; build CDS models\nnpm install\nnpx cds build --production\n\n# 3. Deploy HDI artifacts to SAP HANA Cloud\nnpm run deploy:cf:hana\n\n# 4. Deploy multi-buildpack application droplet (512 MB)\ncf push</code></pre><p>#### Production <code>manifest.yml</code><br><pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">applications:\n  - name: bookshop-multi-buildpack\n    memory: 512M\n    disk_quota: 1024M\n    buildpacks:\n      - python_buildpack\n      - nodejs_buildpack\n    command: npm start\n    routes:\n      - route: bookshop-multi-buildpack.cfapps.us10-003.hana.ondemand.com\n    health-check-type: http\n    health-check-http-endpoint: /healthz\n    timeout: 180\n    env:\n      PYTHON_BIN: python3\n      NODE_ENV: production\n      AI_DESTINATION: google-diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it\n    services:\n      - bookshop-hana\n      - bookshop-destination\n      - bookshop-xsuaa\n      - bookshop-redis</code></pre><hr><h3>2. Local Mode (Developer Workstation)</h3><p>#### Prerequisites<br><ul><li>Node.js 18+ or 20+</li><br><li>Python 3.10+ with <code>pip</code></li><br><li>SQLite (for local CAP persistence)</li><br></ul><br>#### Setup</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 1. Install Node.js dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 2. Set up Python virtual environment\npython3 -m venv python/venv\nsource python/venv/bin/activate   # On Windows: python\\venv\\Scripts\\activate\npip install -r python/requirements.txt\n\n# 3. Initialize SQLite local database with mock data\nnpx cds deploy --to sqlite\n\n# 4. Start local development server\n# Node.js automatically spawns python/functions.py --worker via stdio\nnpm start\n\n# 5. Application is accessible at:\n# http://localhost:4004</code></pre><hr><h3>3. Hybrid Mode (Local Node.js + Remote BTP Services)</h3><p>#### Architecture<br><pre><code class=\"language-plaintext\">┌─────────────────────────────────┐           BTP Service Bindings           ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│  Local Workstation              │ ───────────────────────────────────────► │  SAP BTP Cloud Services     │\n│  - CAP Server (:4004)           │      VCAP_SERVICES / @sap-cloud-sdk      │  - SAP HANA Cloud (Vectors) │\n│  - Co-located Python Worker     │                                          │  - BTP Destination Service  │\n│  - Local Debugger &amp; Hot Reload  │                                          │  - BTP Redis Cache Instance │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘                                          └─────────────────────────────┘</code></pre><p>#### Setup</p><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 1. Bind local CAP server to remote BTP services\nnpx cds bind -2 bookshop-hana:bookshop-hana-key\nnpx cds bind -2 bookshop-destination:bookshop-dest-key\n\n# 2. Run hybrid development server\nnpx cds watch --profile hybrid</code></pre><hr><h2>Environment Comparison</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 840\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"canvas-bg\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0b0f19\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#111827\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"mode-prod\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#065f46\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#042f2e\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"mode-local\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1e3a8a\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#172554\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"mode-hybrid\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7c2d12\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#451a03\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"soft-shadow\" x=\"-5%\" y=\"-5%\" width=\"110%\" height=\"110%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"8\" stdDeviation=\"12\" flood-color=\"#000000\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\" /> </filter> <style> .txt-title { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-hdr { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #ffffff; } .txt-body { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; fill: #e2e8f0; } .txt-dim { font-family: 'Ubuntu', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: #94a3b8; } .txt-code { font-family: 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: #38bdf8; } </style> </defs> <!-- Background Base Container --> <rect width=\"1280\" height=\"840\" fill=\"url(#canvas-bg)\" rx=\"18\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <!-- Diagram Title Header --> <text x=\"640\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-title\">Deployment Modes &amp; Architectural Topologies</text> <text x=\"640\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Production (SAP BTP CF Droplet) • Local Developer Setup (SQLite &amp; Mock) • Hybrid Connected Cloud Mode</text> <!-- Mode 1: Production Mode (w: 380) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"380\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#mode-prod)\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"350\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#022c22\" stroke=\"#10b981\" /> <text x=\"190\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">1. Production Mode (SAP BTP CF)</text> <!-- Architecture details --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#34d399\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">Multi-Buildpack Container Droplet</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• 512 MB RAM Single Container Droplet</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Node.js CAP Edge Gateway (port 8080)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"88\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Python Worker (stdin/stdout JSON-RPC IPC)</text> </g> <!-- BTP Services Binding --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 193)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#34d399\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">Live BTP Services (VCAP_SERVICES)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">🔑 SAP XSUAA (JWT User Authentication)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-dim\">⚡ SAP BTP Redis Instance (&lt; 5ms Prompt Cache)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"92\" class=\"txt-dim\">🗄️ SAP HANA Cloud (REAL_VECTOR 1536 Table)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">🌐 BTP Destination Service (4 AI Endpoints)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"132\" class=\"txt-code\">application-logging-service</text> </g> <!-- Failover sequence --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 353)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"135\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#34d399\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbbf24\">4-Destination Failover Sequence</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">1. google-diffusiongemma-26b-a4b-it (Priority 1)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-dim\">2. google-gemma-4-31b-it (Priority 2 / P2)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"92\" class=\"txt-dim\">3. z-ai-glm-5-2 (Priority 3)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">4. mistralai-mistral-nemotron (Designated Fallback)</text> </g> <!-- Production Commands --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 503)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"190\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#022c22\" stroke=\"#10b981\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"26\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\">Production Deployment &amp; Probes</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"52\" class=\"txt-code\">cf push</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-code\">curl https://.../healthz</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"96\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ {\"status\":\"OK\"}</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"120\" class=\"txt-code\">curl https://.../readyz</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ {\"status\":\"READY\",\"python\":\"OK\"}</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"166\" class=\"txt-code\">npm run test:ai (Integration Test Suite)</text> </g> </g> <!-- Mode 2: Local Development (w: 380) --> <g transform=\"translate(450, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"380\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#mode-local)\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"350\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0c2340\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"190\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">2. Local Development Mode</text> <!-- Architecture details --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">Zero External Dependency Setup</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Port: 4004 (Default CDS Server)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Database: In-memory SQLite (@cap-js/sqlite)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"88\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Python: System Python / virtualenv worker</text> </g> <!-- Local Emulation --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 193)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">Local Emulation Engine</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Mock XSUAA Authentication (dummy auth kind)</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-dim\">• In-memory Vector Store / SQLite embeddings</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"92\" class=\"txt-dim\">• In-memory fallback Prompt Cache</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Direct API Key environment fallback</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"132\" class=\"txt-code\">AI_DISABLE_DESTINATION=true</text> </g> <!-- Testing & Mock --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 353)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"135\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#38bdf8\">REST Client Testing</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Open test/http-requests.http in IDE</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Execute /ai/ask &amp; /browse endpoints</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"92\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Automated mock tests: npm run mock:ai</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Unit tests: npm test</text> </g> <!-- Local Commands --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 503)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"190\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0c2340\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"26\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#bae6fd\">Local Commands &amp; Doc Server</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"52\" class=\"txt-code\">npm install</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-code\">npm start</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"96\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ App live at http://localhost:4004</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"120\" class=\"txt-code\">node scripts/build.js</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"144\" class=\"txt-code\">python3 -m http.server 8888</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"166\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ Docs live at http://localhost:8888</text> </g> </g> <!-- Mode 3: Hybrid Cloud Mode (w: 380) --> <g transform=\"translate(870, 95)\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\"> <rect width=\"380\" height=\"715\" fill=\"url(#mode-hybrid)\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"14\" /> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"18\" width=\"350\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#431407\" stroke=\"#f97316\" /> <text x=\"190\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">3. Hybrid Connected Cloud Mode</text> <!-- Architecture details --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 68)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">Local Code + Remote BTP Cloud</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Run Node.js &amp; Python locally on Mac/Linux</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"68\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Bind live SAP BTP Cloud Foundry services</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"88\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Rapid AI prompt &amp; agent development</text> </g> <!-- Service Key Ingestion --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 193)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">BTP Service Key Ingestion</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-code\">cf create-service-key bookshop-db k1</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-code\">cf service-key bookshop-db k1 &gt; default-env.json</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"94\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Live SAP HANA Cloud REAL_VECTOR query</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Live SAP BTP Destination Service lookup</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"132\" class=\"txt-code\">default-env.json auto-loaded</text> </g> <!-- Live Model Invocation --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 353)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"135\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"24\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fbbf24\">Live Telemetry &amp; Evaluation</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"48\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Live NVIDIA AI Foundation endpoint calls</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"70\" class=\"txt-dim\">• LangSmith real-time tracing &amp; token logging</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"92\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Redis prompt cache performance profiling</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"114\" class=\"txt-dim\">• Fast code iteration with cds watch</text> </g> <!-- Hybrid Commands --> <g transform=\"translate(15, 503)\"> <rect width=\"350\" height=\"190\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#431407\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"26\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#fed7aa\">Hybrid Commands &amp; Eval Benchmark</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"52\" class=\"txt-code\">cds bind --to bookshop-db</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"76\" class=\"txt-code\">cds watch --profile hybrid</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"96\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ Live reload with remote HANA Vector</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"120\" class=\"txt-code\">python python/eval/eval_rag.py</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"140\" class=\"txt-dim\">➔ RAG Triad benchmark suite execution</text> <text x=\"15\" y=\"166\" class=\"txt-code\">npm run test:ai</text> </g> </g></svg></div><hr><h2>Health Probes & Monitoring</h2><h3>Health & Readiness Probes</h3><br><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># System &amp; CAP Memory Health Probe\ncurl http://localhost:4004/healthz\n# Response: {&quot;status&quot;:&quot;OK&quot;,&quot;uptime&quot;:128.4,&quot;memory&quot;:{&quot;rss&quot;:&quot;64MB&quot;}}\n\n# Python IPC Channel &amp; Worker Readiness Probe\ncurl http://localhost:4004/readyz\n# Response: {&quot;status&quot;:&quot;READY&quot;,&quot;python&quot;:&quot;OK&quot;}</code></pre><h3>Cloud Foundry Logs & Telemetry</h3><br><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># Stream real-time logs from Cloud Foundry\ncf logs bookshop-multi-buildpack --recent\n\n# Trace LangSmith agent executions in real-time\nexport LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true\nexport LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=&lt;your-langsmith-key&gt;</code></pre><br></p>","tags":["deployment","sap-btp","multi-buildpack","cap","nodejs","python"],"details":""}